    "updated_at": "2026-03-25T10:05:09Z",
    "body": "It now actually stores the credentials in plain text in `~/.docker/config.json`, so it's not using a credentials store like vscode does? \n\nhttps://dev.to/suin/troubleshooting-docker-credsstore-auto-configuration-issues-in-vs-code-dev-containers-2o46",
