    "body": "Zed development moves fast and a significant number of bugs become outdated. If you can reproduce this bug on the latest stable Zed, please let us know by leaving a comment with the Zed version, it helps us focus on the right issues. If the bug doesn't appear for you anymore, feel free to close the issue yourself; otherwise, the bot will close it in a couple of weeks. But even after it's closed by the bot, you can leave a comment **with the version where the bug is reproducible** and we'll reopen the issue. (This bot will only ask about this issue once) Thanks!",
